<Layout title="Terms of Use"><main id="main" class="content-page article"><h1>Using GlobalCV</h1><p class="lead">GlobalCV provides tools to format information you supply into a resume.</p><h2>Review your document</h2><p>You are responsible for checking the accuracy of your information and the final exported file. Importing can misread or group information incorrectly. Examples contain fictional information and are not claims about you.</p><h2>No hiring guarantee</h2><p>Templates, checklists and country guidance do not guarantee that an applicant tracking system will process a document in a particular way or that an employer will offer an interview. Follow the instructions in each vacancy.</p><h2>Responsible use</h2><p>Only upload documents you are entitled to use. Do not attempt to access another person’s drafts, abuse the service, or use the tool to misrepresent qualifications.</p><h2>Availability</h2><p>The service may change or be temporarily unavailable. Keep copies of important final documents. Saved accounts support up to 100 drafts in this version.</p><h2>Free core features</h2><p>Creating, editing and downloading a PDF do not require payment or an account. Saving an account draft requires authentication.</p></main></Layout>
